Third-party dependencies
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

This package vendors no third-party source. It DEPENDS on the official Model
Context Protocol SDKs, resolved by the consumer's package manager and pinned in
vendor/VERSIONS:

  * MCP Swift SDK   - MIT - https://github.com/modelcontextprotocol/swift-sdk
  * MCP Kotlin SDK  - MIT - https://github.com/modelcontextprotocol/kotlin-sdk

Both are permissive. Neither is redistributed here; each carries its own LICENSE
in its own distribution.

The local MCP server does NOT depend on an HTTP server framework. The
Streamable-HTTP framing runs on this package's own bounded loopback listener,
which is a deliberate choice and not an omission: an on-device server framework
would be a second network surface with its own defaults, and the security story
here is the listener's bind address, its token check and its file modes.
